    "finalName": "",
    "description": "When you roll <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">Initiative</a> at the beginning of combat, also roll a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check, comparing the result to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a> of all enemies in line of sight. If your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check is successful, that target cannot attack you and does not believe you to be an enemy (though they do not consider you an ally) while this effect is active.<br><br>If you attack or otherwise obviously harm or hinder a target under the effect of this Talent, or one of that target's allies, this effect ends. This is a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mind-Affecting\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind-Affecting\">Mind-Affecting</a> effect.",
